<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"></head><body style="margin:0;padding:28px 12px;background:#f4f7fa;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#182331"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;margin:auto;background:#fff;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:28px 30px;background:#080c12;color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:700">Codest</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:32px 30px"><h1 style="font-size:24px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 16px">제작문의가 접수되었습니다.</h1><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 26px">안녕하세요, {{name}}님.<br>내용을 확인한 뒤 연락드리겠습니다.</p><table role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-top:2px solid #20c0ff;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7"><tr><th style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:12px 8px 12px 0;width:96px">접수번호</th><td style="padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{receiptId}}</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:12px 8px 12px 0">이름</th><td style="padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{name}}</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:12px 8px 12px 0">전화번호</th><td style="padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{phone}}</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:12px 8px 12px 0">이메일</th><td style="padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{email}}</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:12px 8px 12px 0">제작내용</th><td style="padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{#each messageLines}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}<br>{{/unless}}{{/each}}</td></tr></table><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#617081;margin:28px 0 0">이 메일에 답장하시면 Codest 담당자에게 전달됩니다.</p></td></tr></table></body></html>
